{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "a02ecc27-1a2b-8105-bb5c-213116290d43",
  "created_at": "2026-01-13T10:26:28-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Moira Quinn",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:22:34-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:22:39-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, hi. Um, I'm calling about a storm drain. Hmm, let me see how to say this. The one in the parking lot behind my building, on Marsh Street, down the Point."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:22:53-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. What's the address on Marsh Street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:22:57-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "88 Marsh Street. It's the lot in back, not the street side. Well, the drain's in the lot, I mean."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:23:06-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "88 Marsh Street, the lot behind the building. And what's it doing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:23:12-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's clogged, or it's not taking water, anyway. After that coastal storm that ended Saturday, three days ago, the whole lot pooled up and the water ran right to the back door. It's sloped that way, so it all goes toward the entrance. Three days later there's still a puddle at the door."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:23:33-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So the water's reaching the back entrance of the building. Is it getting inside?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:23:39-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's right at the threshold, um, it came in a little on Saturday, I put towels down. And this keeps happening, every time we get a real rain it's the same thing. I've mentioned it, well, I thought somebody would've dealt with it by now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:23:57-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry, that's a hassle. Let me write that down so I have it right. Drain in the back lot at 88 Marsh, blocked or not draining, water running to the back door."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:24:11-05:00",
      "duration": 24,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. And hmm, the other thing is the water's not just sitting in the lot. It runs down toward the water, toward the end of the street. There's kids that cut through there, and people walking dogs all the time. I worry somebody's going to slip or, you know, get too close to the edge when it's all flooded like that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:24:35-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood, so there's a safety concern too with foot traffic near the water. I'll put that in the notes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:24:43-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. So what I'm asking is, can somebody come clean the drain out? Like, actually clear it. Not just look at it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:24:53-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's what the request is for, to get a crew out to inspect it and clean it if it's blocked. I can't tell you the exact day, they're backed up after a storm like that, but it goes to the crew supervisor today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:25:10-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Hmm. Is there a number I should write down for follow up? My father keeps telling me to look in the phone book. He has this paper phone book, he swears by it, and he's like, just look under city government. I said Dad, nobody uses that. But, well, here I am calling."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:25:31-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Well, he's not wrong that it's in there. You can reach Public Works through the main city line, and you've got me now. Do you want me to take a callback number for you, too?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:25:46-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, sure. It's 401-555-0163."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:25:48-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0163. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:25:50-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Moira Quinn. Q-U-I-N-N."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:25:52-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Moira Quinn, 88 Marsh Street, back lot drain, call back at 401-555-0163. Did I get all that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:25:59-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. Um, one more thing, if it's going to be a while, can somebody at least tell me? Because I'd rather not find out the hard way when the next storm comes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:26:12-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll note that you'd like a call when they schedule it. Somebody from the department will get back to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:26:21-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thanks, Lorraine. I appreciate it. Bye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:26:25-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Moira. Take care."
    }
  ],
